# Frontend (Next.js)

- Read `frontend/node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing Next.js code — this project uses Next.js 16 with breaking changes.
- App Router pages under `frontend/app/`. Arena components in `frontend/components/arena/`, shadcn UI in `frontend/components/ui/`.
- Call backend via relative `/api/*` paths (proxied to `:8000`).
- Mirror backend curriculum models in `frontend/lib/types.ts` and session models in `frontend/lib/session/types.ts` when changing API contracts.
